{"4581790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CYBERPHOTO", "steam_appid": 4581790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBERPHOTO is a sci-fi exploration and photography experience set across abandoned alien worlds filled with mystery and forgotten technology. Step into the role of a futuristic photographer equipped with advanced tools, allowing you to <strong>capture dynamic photo</strong>s using filters, lighting control, and even <strong>weather manipulation</strong> to create the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras/7dcca8c41e820284d172881f78c5d70a.avif?t=1788306337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras_big/7dcca8c41e820284d172881f78c5d70a.webp?t=1788306337 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple unique levels, each populated with diverse robotic lifeforms and alien species that walk, swim, and fly. Interact with the environment by uncovering hidden notes, placing objects, and restoring fragments of lost civilizations, all while building your own progression through meaningful stats and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras/04ee8e3da340b1c529335dde88a8d9e0.avif?t=1788306337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras_big/04ee8e3da340b1c529335dde88a8d9e0.webp?t=1788306337 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your best shots, complete contracts, and grow your reputation across the galaxy. Along the way, you’re not alone: care for your loyal robo-dog companion, ensuring it stays maintained and ready to assist you on your journey.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBERPHOTO is a sci-fi exploration and photography experience set across abandoned alien worlds filled with mystery and forgotten technology. Step into the role of a futuristic photographer equipped with advanced tools, allowing you to <strong>capture dynamic photo</strong>s using filters, lighting control, and even <strong>weather manipulation</strong> to create the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras/7dcca8c41e820284d172881f78c5d70a.avif?t=1788306337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras_big/7dcca8c41e820284d172881f78c5d70a.webp?t=1788306337 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple unique levels, each populated with diverse robotic lifeforms and alien species that walk, swim, and fly. Interact with the environment by uncovering hidden notes, placing objects, and restoring fragments of lost civilizations, all while building your own progression through meaningful stats and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras/04ee8e3da340b1c529335dde88a8d9e0.avif?t=1788306337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581790/extras_big/04ee8e3da340b1c529335dde88a8d9e0.webp?t=1788306337 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your best shots, complete contracts, and grow your reputation across the galaxy. Along the way, you’re not alone: care for your loyal robo-dog companion, ensuring it stays maintained and ready to assist you on your journey.</p>", "short_descr